Description: FIIL earbuds control panel for Linux
 Qt Quick control panel for FIIL (Bluetrum based) TWS earbuds, talking to
 them over classic Bluetooth RFCOMM/SPP -- no phone app needed.
 .
 Features: battery levels, low-latency mode, single-ear noise cancelling,
 LDAC switch, multipoint, adaptive DSP switches, 10-band EQ (presets and
 custom), key/gesture remapping, pair list management and a raw protocol log.
